odh paksh).]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-you-want-rahul-vs-pm-modi-open-debate-congress-leader-runs-up-public-poll-asks-bjp-top-brass-to-convince/articleshow/135504251.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-you-want-rahul-vs-pm-modi-open-debate-congress-leader-runs-up-public-poll-asks-bjp-top-brass-to-convince/articleshow/135504251.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T21:05:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135504947,imgsize-108842.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Parking place for defectors’: Congress targets Amit Shah over formation of Arunachal Janata Party]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/parking-place-for-defectors-congress-targets-amit-shah-over-formation-of-arunachal-janata-party/articleshow/135503480.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135503480.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/parking-place-for-defectors-congress-targets-amit-shah-over-formation-of-arunachal-janata-party/articleshow/135503480.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/parking-place-for-defectors-congress-targets-amit-shah-over-formation-of-arunachal-janata-party/articleshow/135503480.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T20:14:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135503608,imgsize-1618323.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[EC allows voters deleted from draft electoral rolls to use Form 6 for re-inclusion]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ec-allows-voters-deleted-fro