watch]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/24-hours-have-passed-modi-ji-rahul-renews-debate-challenge-to-pm-over-foreign-links-watch/articleshow/135500543.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135500543.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi has extended a challenge to Prime Minister Narendra Modi for an open debate on several allegations. He outlined topics including foreign influence, the Adani case, and financial matters that require discussion. Rahul gandhi further suggested that the debate take place in the presence of media and youth, proposing Mohan Bhagwat as a moderator.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/24-hours-have-passed-modi-ji-rahul-renews-debate-challenge-to-pm-over-foreign-links-watch/articleshow/135500543.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/24-hours-have-passed-modi-ji-rahul-renews-debate-challenge-to-pm-over-foreign-links-watch/articleshow/135500543.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T18:42:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kanchan Yadav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135501056,imgsize-821741.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bihar CM Samrat Chaudhary says ‘crime might happen, but not apradh’; Tejashwi takes swipe]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bihar-cm-samrat-chaudhary-says-crime-might-happen-but-not-apradh-tejashwi-takes-swipe/articleshow/135500927.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135500927.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bihar-cm-samrat-chaudhary-says-crime-might-happen-but-not-apradh-tejashwi-takes-swipe/articleshow/13550