imesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135493271.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Neha Bora has been actively involved in protests against Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar over alleged irregularities in the Special Intensive Revision (SIR) of electoral rolls. She took part in an October 10 demonstration organised by the Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) and student groups in Delhi. Police detained several protesters, including Bora, as restrictions on public gatherings were imposed in parts of the capital.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/radical-thinking-india-bloc-allies-snub-left-leader-neha-boras-brahmanvaad-remark/articleshow/135493271.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/radical-thinking-india-bloc-allies-snub-left-leader-neha-boras-brahmanvaad-remark/articleshow/135493271.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T17:01:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135494753,imgsize-78920.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bhutan's glacial lake outburst exposes growing disaster threat across the Himalayas]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhutans-glacial-lake-outburst-exposes-growing-disaster-threat-across-the-himalaya/articleshow/135494207.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135494207.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Bhutan experienced a significant glacial lake outburst that raised concerns regarding devastating glacial floods in the Himalayas. Authorities are monitoring a temporary lake created by debris from the initial flood event. The risks posed by melting glaciers are increasingly threatening both infrastructure and communities across the region. India, sharing river systems with Bhutan, has started its own review of disaster preparedness plans.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhutans-glacial-lake-outburst-exposes-growing-disaster-threat-across-the-himalaya/articleshow/135494207.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhutans-glacial-lake-outburst-exposes-growing-disaster-threat-across-the-himalaya/articleshow/135494207.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T16:50:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135494545,imgsize-383882.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Incompatible with secular character': Centre tells Delhi HC mosque inside Krishi Bhawan must be demolished]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mosque-inside-krishi-bhawan-cannot-be-retained-site-needed-for-central-vista-project-centre-to-delhi-hc/articleshow/135491629.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135491629.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mosque-inside-krishi-bhawan-cannot-be-retained-site-needed-for-central-vista-project-centre-to-delhi-hc/articleshow/135491629.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mosque-inside-krishi-bhawan-cannot-be-retained-site-needed-for-central-vista-project-centre-to-delhi-hc/articleshow/135491629.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T15:20:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135491714,imgsize-70694.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ex-Air chief AP Singh wrote to Rajnath, urged him to keep Race Course land under IAF control]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ex-air-chief-ap-singh-wrote-to-rajnath-u